  # TextMesh Pro (com.unity.ugui) shaders. The welcome screen builds its TMP font
  # assets at runtime and resolves "TextMeshPro/Mobile/Distance Field" +
  # "TextMeshPro/Distance Field" via Shader.Find, so they MUST ship in the build
  # or TMP text renders invisible/pink on device.
